  <forces>
    <force id="force0" name="Adeptus Custodes" catalogueName="Adeptus Custodes">
      <selections>
        <selection id="unit0" name="Caladius Annihilator Grav-tank" type="unit" number="1">
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Caladius Annihilator Grav Tank" typeName="Unit">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="M">10"</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="T">11</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="SV">2+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="W">14</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="LD">5+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="OC">4</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Advanced Firepower" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">While making ranged attacks, while the target is an enemy unit with the MONSTER or VEHICLE keyword:
  -&gt; You can re-roll one Hit roll.
  -&gt; You can re-roll one Wound roll.
  -&gt; You can re-roll one Damage roll.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Damaged" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Deadly Demise" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Deep Strike" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Aegis of the Emperor" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">All friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES units with the Aegis of the Emperor ability have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability against mortal wounds.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <categories>
